      "requested": "India State-Level Disease Burden Initiative / GBD India (ICMR, PHFI, IHME)",
      "why_not": "No machine-readable open extract: the IHME GBD Results Tool is an interactive query UI, and the ICMR/PHFI India State-Level report is a 22MB PDF of typeset tables. Transcribing DALYs from a PDF by eye would put unverifiable numbers in the repository.",
      "consequence": "These are WHO national estimates, not ICMR/PHFI/IHME state-level estimates, and they will not match published GBD India figures.",
      "second_attempt_2026_11_18": {
        "candidate": "India State-Level Disease Burden Initiative, hosted on Redivis by the Stanford Center for Population Health Sciences (DOI 10.57761/hwzj-cv34)",
        "api_probe": "https://redivis.com/api/v1/datasets/stanfordphs.india_state_level_disease_burden_initiative returns accessLevel \"data\" with tableCount 0, and its /tables listing is empty, unauthenticated",
        "blocked_by": "registration: the tables are gated behind a Stanford Redivis account and data-use approval, which is the user's institutional access to grant, not something this build can obtain",
        "vintage_note": "the extract covers GBD 2016 (1990-2016), older than the WHO GHE 2023 estimates already in use, so it would not be a straightforward upgrade even with access",
        "outcome": "skipped. Adding it remains worthwhile for anyone with that access: it would give state-level granularity alongside, not instead of, WHO GHE."
      }
    }
